==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Gabriel]]s spawn after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>, delay 20~26.67 seconds<sup>600f~800f</sup>.
*5 [[Gabriel]]s spawn after 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>, delay 40~46.67 seconds<sup>1,200f~1,400f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Shibalien Elite]]s spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 30~36.67 seconds<sup>900f~1,100f</sup>.
*8 [[Heavenly Hippoe]]s spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 53.33~60 seconds<sup>1,600f~1,800f</sup>.
*5 [[Mistress Celeboodle]]s spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 53.33~60 seconds<sup>1,600f~1,800f</sup>.
*1 [[Winged Pigge]] spawns as the boss after 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>.
*1 [[Commander Ostromeda]] spawns after 66.67 seconds<sup>2,000f</sup>.

==Strategy==
After [[Heaven's Oasis]] got demolished on every difficulty via power creep, it went to Hell and got Satan's strongest agent, Winged Pigge, and Commander Ostromeda. Ostromeda might seem pretty easy at first glance, but its increased range of 290 compared to [[R.Ost]]'s 260, increased damage allowing it to one-shot [[Crazed Tank Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Manic Eraser Cat]], and Warp makes it really annoying. Your best bet for it is to use [[Psychocat (Rare Cat)|Corrupted Psychocat]] to control it and either [[Catellite]] or [[Bakery Cat (Rare Cat)|Fried Chicken Cat]] along with [[Jetpack Cat (Rare Cat)|Kinjirou]]/[[Ancient Egg: N108 (Super Rare Cat)|Soap Cat]] and chip it down slowly after that.

The main important thing to note with this stage is that it's timer-based, with Winged Pigge spawning before Ostromeda, meaning you can abuse this timeframe to beat up Winged Pigge. Your main helpers here are a [[Talents|Talented]] [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Awakened Bahamut Cat]] combined with Curse from either [[Master of Life Dr. Nova (Special Cat)|Master of Life Catnova]] or Fried Chicken alongside [[Phantom Cat (Rare Cat)|Bubble Cat]], who is Immune to Weaken and can deal huge amounts of damage to Winged Pigge. You can get even more damage off with the assistance of a well-timed [[Thunderbolt]]. Once Ostromeda spawns, Winged Pigge should either be dead or have very low health. From here, manage your money carefully and chip down Winged Pigge with Catnova or [[Nerd Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Cyberpunk Cat]] until she dies. From there, you can take your time chipping down Ostromeda by spamming Psychocats and other backliners like [[Li'l Lizard Cat (Special Cat)|Li'l King Dragon Cats]] and Bubble Cats.

==Trivia==
*In all versions except [[Nyanko Daisensou|BCJP]], Creamy Snowplain was [[Commander Ostromeda]]'s first appearance overall, as [[Anniversary/12 1/2 Year#Arrival of the Blue Ship|Arrival of the Blue Ship]] still hadn't been released outside of Japan by the time [[Patisserie Parklands]] was added to other versions.

